  "statuteText": "141-C:20-d Exclusion During Outbreak of Disease. –\n\nDuring an outbreak of a communicable disease for which immunization is required under RSA 141-C:20-a, children exempted under RSA 141-C:20-c shall not attend the school or child care agency threatened by the communicable disease. The commissioner shall prepare a written order as required under RSA 141-C:12, I."
